<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>BootLoader - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/BootLoader/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:40:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/BootLoader/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Android 开发环境配置1：详解Bootloader</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-bootloader/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/android-development-environment-bootloader/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在刚接触Android开发时，通常需要对设备进行root操作，而在root之前，必须要做的一步就是先对设备的Bootloader进行解锁。那么什么是Bootloader？为什么必须要对Bootloader进行解锁？如何对Bootloader进行解锁？本文便围绕着几个问题展开进行介绍。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>